# #39: legacy un-prefixed event URLs (existing bookmarks/social links) now
# live under /trieste — the only chapter that existed before path-based chapter
# routing. Forced (!) so these always redirect rather than falling through
# to a same-path static file, since none should exist for /events* anymore.
/events                /trieste/events                301!
/events/:slug          /trieste/events/:slug          301!

